  "finding": "Microsoft's UI Automation ComboBox specification requires ExpandCollapsePattern. The captured native tree had the correct ComboBox name and control type, but the pinned AccessKit Windows adapter exposed no ExpandCollapsePattern, so the audit could not open the popup or establish application-data baselines.",
  "correction": "Replace this selector with an accessible menu button whose InvokePattern opens radio options, and select the nested note through SelectionItemPattern. The audit will also verify the selected value and no-write snapshots.",
  "reference": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/winauto/uiauto-supportcomboboxcontroltype",
  "local_validation": "none; GitHub Actions was the only test venue."
